    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything attacks you in unexpected and hilarious ways in this experimental survival crafting game.  </strong><br><strong>Can you beat it? Co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.poster.avif?t=1754425152\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.webm?t=1754425152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.mp4?t=1754425152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the survival crafting genre in a brand new way where\u00a0every action will have an unexpected, hilarious consequence that might just kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools and weapons, fight creatures, build workbenches and utilities, farm plants, and explore to find the hilarious and unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, many times, over and over again, die. (but hopefully in a funny, non frustrating way!)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything attacks you in unexpected and hilarious ways in this experimental survival crafting game.  </strong><br><strong>Can you beat it? Co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.poster.avif?t=1754425152\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.webm?t=1754425152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746680/extras/e17b24c1949bf25c4e0e1385f9c53ac8.mp4?t=1754425152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the survival crafting genre in a brand new way where\u00a0every action will have an unexpected, hilarious consequence that might just kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools and weapons, fight creatures, build workbenches and utilities, farm plants, and explore to find the hilarious and unexpected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, many times, over and over again, die. (but hopefully in a funny, non frustrating way!)</p></li></ul>",
